      <subsection xml:id="subsec-future-work">
        <title>Future Work</title>

        <p>
          The next steps are prospective replication across offerings and
          institutions, qualitative validation of selected trajectory patterns,
          grouping-aware comparison of partially correct states, and a deliberately
          designed study of feedback policy.  A separate software study can test
          the canonical adapter contract using another authoring or delivery
          environment.  Advanced transition, Markov, and network analyses should
          follow only after reconstruction validity and interpretive boundaries
          are established.
        </p>
      </subsection>

